_🧹 Nitpick_ | _🔵 Trivial_

**Avoid using index as key.**

Using array index as key is an anti-pattern that can cause rendering issues when data is reordered or filtered. Use a unique identifier from the data instead.



<details>
<summary>♻️ Recommended solution</summary>

If the data has a unique identifier, use it:
```diff
-<View key={index} style={styles.barContainer}>
+<View key={`${item.label}-${item.value}`} style={styles.barContainer}>
```

Or update the `BarChartProps` interface to require unique IDs:
```typescript
interface BarChartProps {
  data: {
    id: string;
    label: string;
    value: number;
  }[];
  color: string;
  maxValue?: number;
}
```
</details>


